# close.svg, maximize.svg, restore.svg, and minimize.svg each include a nearly-
# transparent 20x20 rect inside every FrameSvg state. That rect is structural:
# KSvg crops
# a "*-center" element to its own bounding box before scaling it to the button
# size. Without the full-size rect, the small glyph itself becomes the crop and
# gets enlarged to fill the whole button (the oversized X/box/solid bar seen in
# the original build). Keep the rects even though they are visually invisible.
